{"4958580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Seven Will Die", "steam_appid": 4958580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seven strangers. One cursed manor. One night that will change everything.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Seven Will Die</i></strong> is a dark point-and-click adventure set in a sprawling Victorian manor on the night seven guests discover they have something in common - they will all be dead soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are called to investigate a presumed thief and you end up investigating seven murders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A remake of the old, 1980's Mystery House with modern assets, graphics, music and riddles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic point-and-click gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D pre-rendered backgrounds with real-time 3D characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different plot, murderer and ending that than original Mystery House</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music and sound effects — atmospheric soundtrack composed specifically for the manor and its visitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created puzzles — from combination locks and rune dials to tile and music puzzles. Solve one puzzle — another one is murdered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/32ec792a49a5cbf8563a5e29def22b70.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=132 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/bc3344389e4a6c61f94612fd48b4d1aa.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=132 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/407b058be89ed2f9631c770dac6cdb7b.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/fe373848295a4d7929e248822764ee25.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=132 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/7afceb4b1b75e39d0381bb245fb07fd7.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=132 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/4811dccddea0e6a83334cade78701f07.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Word From the Developer </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have been playing adventure games since 1990 and dreaming of making one almost as long. I am a low-level C++ developer by trade — not an artist, not an animator — and for most of that time, making a game of this kind felt genuinely out of reach. The combination of Unity, Adventure Creator, Turbo Play and the AI-assisted tools I built into my own engine finally made it possible. Every room in this manor is a place I wanted to visit. I hope you feel the same way when you step inside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seven strangers. One cursed manor. One night that will change everything.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Seven Will Die</i></strong> is a dark point-and-click adventure set in a sprawling Victorian manor on the night seven guests discover they have something in common - they will all be dead soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are called to investigate a presumed thief and you end up investigating seven murders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A remake of the old, 1980's Mystery House with modern assets, graphics, music and riddles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic point-and-click gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D pre-rendered backgrounds with real-time 3D characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different plot, murderer and ending that than original Mystery House</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music and sound effects — atmospheric soundtrack composed specifically for the manor and its visitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created puzzles — from combination locks and rune dials to tile and music puzzles. Solve one puzzle — another one is murdered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/32ec792a49a5cbf8563a5e29def22b70.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=132 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/bc3344389e4a6c61f94612fd48b4d1aa.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=132 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/407b058be89ed2f9631c770dac6cdb7b.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/fe373848295a4d7929e248822764ee25.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=132 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/7afceb4b1b75e39d0381bb245fb07fd7.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=132 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/extras/4811dccddea0e6a83334cade78701f07.avif?t=1787227348\" width=236 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Word From the Developer </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have been playing adventure games since 1990 and dreaming of making one almost as long. I am a low-level C++ developer by trade — not an artist, not an animator — and for most of that time, making a game of this kind felt genuinely out of reach. The combination of Unity, Adventure Creator, Turbo Play and the AI-assisted tools I built into my own engine finally made it possible. Every room in this manor is a place I wanted to visit. I hope you feel the same way when you step inside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A 3D modern remake of the classic Mystery House, along with original music, different plot and creepy atmosphere.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Greek, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/f0253da6cd2e2c7655809a8cefe5efb82c539600/header.jpg?t=1787227348", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/4e7b96a0257689811e5a2068e5238417765610a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787227348", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958580/4e7b96a0257689811e5a2068e5238417765610a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787227348", "website": "https://www.thesevenwilldie.com?from=steam", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended"